Description: Mass spectrometry (MS) data backend for the Spectra
    Bioconductor package that stores and retrieves spectra and peak data
    from on-disk Apache Parquet datasets. Spectra metadata together with
    m/z and intensity values are stored in a columnar Parquet format that
    supports compression, dictionary encoding and Hive-style partitioning.
    Datasets are written with the Apache Arrow R bindings and queried with
    DuckDB. Spectra variables are held in a bounded in-memory index so
    that filtering and metadata access are fast while peak data remains on
    disk.
